e_item_assets/steam/apps/3880060/extras/39b8add99604e8ebfe139afb75cda4ca.mp4?t=1783865124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it finds you, the chase begins. Escape before it turns you into one of its  creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880060/extras/e6619187694c3605bb4281fe24636b5c.avif?t=1783865124\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assisted by its corrupted creations which are remnants of those who failed to escape now seek to get you caught. LOOK and STAY away from them. Will you escape? Or fail and turn corrupted...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>",
